"type":"objective","section":null},{"question":"In the pyramid each number is the sum of the two numbers immediately below it. (Top: \\( z,\\,56 \\); next: \\( 19,\\,x,\\,28 \\); then \\( 7,\\,y,\\ldots \\); bottom: \\( k,\\,7,\\,m \\).) Find \\( x \\).","options":["\\( 28 \\)","\\( 32 \\)","\\( 36 \\)","\\( 40 \\)","\\( 45 \\)"],"correctIndex":0,"answer":null,"accept":null,"explanation":["\\( 56 = x + 28 \\Rightarrow x = 28 \\). ⚠ Pyramid reconstructed from the scan — verify against the official key."],"hint":"\\( 56 \\) sits above \\( x \\) and \\( 28 \\), so \\( 56 = x + 28 \\).","image":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 220 150\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\"><rect x=\"55\" y=\"10\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"30\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">z</text><rect x=\"105\" y=\"10\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"30\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">56</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"45\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"65\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">19</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"45\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\"/><text x=\"105\" y=\"65\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x</text><rect x=\"130\" y=\"45\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\"/><text x=\"155\" y=\"65\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">28</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"80\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"100\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><rect x=\"105\" y=\"80\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"100\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">y</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"115\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\"/><text x=\"75\" y=\"134\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">k</text><rect x=\"95\" y=\"115\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"134\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><rect x=\"135\" y=\"115\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\"/><text x=\"155\" y=\"134\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">m</text></svg>","topic":null,"type":"objective","section":null},{"question":"Using the same pyramid, find \\( y \\).","options":["\\( 10 \\)","\\( 12 \\)","\\( 16 \\)","\\( 20 \\)","\\( 26 \\)"],"correctIndex":1,"answer":null,"accept":null,"explanation":["\\( 19 = 7 + y \\Rightarrow y = 12 \\). ⚠ Reconstructed — verify against the official key."],"hint":"\\( 19 \\) sits above \\( 7 \\) and \\( y \\).","image":null,"topic":null,"type":"objective","section":null},{"question":"Using the same pyramid, find \\( z \\).","options":["\\( 12 \\)","\\( 20 \\)","\\( 38 \\)","\\( 47 \\)","\\( 50 \\)"],"correctIndex":3,"answer":null,"accept":null,"explanation":["\\( z = 19 + x = 19 + 28 = 47 \\). ⚠ Reconstructed — verify against the official key."],"hint":"\\( z \\) sits above \\( 19 \\) and \\( x \\).","image":null,"topic":null,"type":"objective","section":null},{"question":"Using the same pyramid, find \\( k+m \\).","options":["\\( 12 \\)","\\( 10 \\)","\\( 8 \\)","\\( 7 \\)","\\( 5 \\)"],"correctIndex":4,"answer":null,"accept":null,"explanation":["The bottom row \\( (2,5,7,9,3) \\) reproduces the pyramid, giving \\( k=2,\\,m=3 \\), so \\( k+m = 5 \\). ⚠ Reconstructed — verify against the official key."],"hint":"Build the bottom row so that each cell above is the sum of the two below it.","image":null,"topic":null,"type":"objective","section":null}]}